:: capture default speaker="Archivist" enabled=true count=3 offset=-12.5 whole=+7 tags=[dock, "night watch"]
> capture_line@0123456789abcdef0123 speaker=archivist bind=(name:string=$name)
  [quiet]Found {name}.[/quiet]
  Plain prose.
  Interpolated {name} prose.
  | Plural {count} prose.
:if not sealed() and stage("open")
  ! immediate play_sfx("relay", -4.25)
  -> archive.recite::opening
  -> END
  - Hyphen-led prose.
